Cell["\<\
The Jacobian measures how small changes behave near an equilibrium. Negative \
eigenvalues mean the model returns toward the equilibrium. A positive \
eigenvalue means small changes can grow.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"24722a46-8b0c-dd4c-a85a-a26e510efa90"],

